  <name>dosui</name>
  <summary>Lightweight native frontend for DOSBox</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      dosui is a lightweight, native Linux frontend for DOSBox — a game and
      profile launcher and configuration manager in the spirit of D-Fend
      Reloaded, but without a Java runtime.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Profile library with cover art, a sortable details list, and an icon view.</li>
      <li>Tabbed profile editor with a live dosbox.conf preview.</li>
      <li>New-profile wizard that scans a folder for executables.</li>
      <li>Global defaults with per-profile overrides.</li>
      <li>Category sidebar and find-as-you-type search.</li>
      <li>Import from dosbox.conf (D-Fend / DBGL) and zipped games.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.dosui.desktop</launchable>

