  <releases>
    <release version="0.3.0" date="2026-06-30">
      <description>
        <p>Desktop integration and a command-line interface.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Opt-in shortcuts: dosui asks before adding an applications-menu entry and a desktop launcher, with Add/Remove buttons in Settings.</li>
          <li>Command-line options: --install, --uninstall, --version, --help.</li>
          <li>Bundles dosbox-staging 0.82.2.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
